{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive video banner section from scratch with the following behavior:
    
    1. Video source
    
    Add a video upload field for desktop (MP4 / WebM).
    
    Add a video upload field for mobile (MP4 / WebM).
    
    On desktop, use the desktop video.
    
    On mobile, use the mobile video.
    
    If the mobile video is empty, use the desktop video as fallback.
    
    2. Video sizing (very important)
    
    The video must:
    
    Always use width: 100%; and height: auto;
    
    Not use aspect-ratio, fixed height, or object-fit.
    
    The full video frame must be visible (no cropping, no masking).
    
    The banner height should follow the natural aspect ratio of the video.
    
    3. Video behavior
    
    The <video> element must:
    
    autoplay
    
    loop
    
    be muted
    
    play inline on mobile (no fullscreen forced)
    
    4. Optional content
    
    Add optional fields for:
    
    Title
    
    Subtitle
    
    Button label + link
    
    Text and button should be positioned over the video or below it, but:
    
    If the field is empty, that element should not render.
    
    5. Style (keep it minimal)
    
    No hover zoom or movement on the video.
    
    Simple, minimal layout that works on desktop and mobile.
    
    Please keep the code as simple as possible and do not add extra sizing logic beyond width: 100%; height: auto;., The video banner section was created, but the video does not appear on the page, make the video appear correctly., Please update this video banner section with the adjustments below:
    
    1. Title font control
    
    Add a font picker in the theme editor for the title.
    
    The selected font-family must correctly override any default styling.
    
    Do not change subtitle or button fonts — only the title.
    
    2. Button border customization
    Add the following settings for the CTA button:
    
    Border color picker
    
    Border width control (in px)
    
    Border style (solid)
    
    Keep border-radius at 0px (square button)
    
    Button background must remain optional/transparent (no forced background).
    
    Requirements:
    
    These settings must update instantly and not break layout, alignment, or video behavior.
    
    Do not change anything else in the section., Please update this video banner section to allow customizing the CTA button size.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Button size controls
    
    Add theme editor settings for:
    
    Button padding (top/bottom and left/right) in px
    
    Button font size in px
    
    Button width option:
    
    Auto (fits text)
    
    Full width
    
    Keep existing button styling
    
    Keep the border color, border width, transparent background and 0px border-radius exactly as they are.
    
    Do not change any other part of the section
    
    Don’t modify title, video behavior, layout, alignment, etc., Please update this video banner section so the CTA button background can be fully transparent.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Transparent background option
    
    Add a setting in the theme editor to choose the button background color, including the ability to set it to transparent.
    
    Remove any hard-coded background color applied to the button.
    
    Keep existing styles
    
    Preserve the button’s border settings (color + width).
    
    Keep border-radius at 0px (square button).
    
    Do not override the text color setting.
    
    No other changes
    
    Do not modify layout, video behavior, title styling, or any other part of the section., Please update this video banner section to add hover styling for the CTA button.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Hover color settings
    
    Add theme editor settings for:
    • Hover background color
    • Hover text color
    • Hover border color
    
    When the user hovers over the button, these colors must replace the default ones.
    
    Transition
    
    Add a smooth transition (e.g. 0.2s ease) for the hover effect.
    
    Do not change anything else
    
    Keep the current button shape (0px border-radius), border width, transparency options, and overall layout exactly as they are.
    
    Do not modify video behavior or text settings.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-video-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-video-banner__video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-video-banner__desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-video-banner__mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-video-banner__desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-video-banner__mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .ai-video-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    {% if block.settings.content_position == 'overlay' %}
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 2;
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 600px;
    {% else %}
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-video-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.title_font.style }};
  }

  .ai-video-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-video-banner__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    {% if block.settings.button_bg_color != blank and block.settings.button_bg_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: transparent;
    {% endif %}
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 0px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    {% if block.settings.button_width == 'full' %}
      width: 100%;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-video-banner__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.button_hover_bg_color != blank and block.settings.button_hover_bg_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: transparent;
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.button_hover_text_color != blank %}
      color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.button_hover_border_color != blank %}
      border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-video-banner__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 400px;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-video-banner__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-video-banner__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-video-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.title_size }}px * 0.7);
    }

    .ai-video-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-video-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.content_position == 'overlay' %}
        width: 85%;
      {% else %}
        padding: 30px 16px;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-video-banner__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 300px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-video-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.video_desktop != blank or block.settings.video_mobile != blank %}
    {% if block.settings.video_desktop != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-video-banner__video-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-banner__desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline
      >
        {% for source in block.settings.video_desktop.sources %}
          <source src="{{ source.url }}" type="{{ source.mime_type }}">
        {% endfor %}
      </video>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.video_mobile != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-video-banner__video-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-banner__mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline
      >
        {% for source in block.settings.video_mobile.sources %}
          <source src="{{ source.url }}" type="{{ source.mime_type }}">
        {% endfor %}
      </video>
    {% elsif block.settings.video_desktop != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-video-banner__video-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-banner__mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline
      >
        {% for source in block.settings.video_desktop.sources %}
          <source src="{{ source.url }}" type="{{ source.mime_type }}">
        {% endfor %}
      </video>
    {% endif %}
  {% else %}
    <div class="ai-video-banner__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
      <div class="ai-video-banner__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        Next, add a video
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.subtitle != blank or block.settings.button_label != blank %}
    <div class="ai-video-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-video-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
        <p class="ai-video-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.button_label != blank and block.settings.button_link != blank %}
        <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-video-banner__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.button_label }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Video banner",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Video"
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "video_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop video"
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "video_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile video"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If mobile video is empty, desktop video will be used as fallback."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button label"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_position",
      "label": "Content position",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "overlay",
          "label": "Over video"
        },
        {
          "value": "below",
          "label": "Below video"
        }
      ],
      "default": "overlay"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Style"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "title_font",
      "label": "Title font",
      "default": "assistant_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Title size",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "subtitle_size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Subtitle size",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg_color",
      "label": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text_color",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_border_color",
      "label": "Border color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_border_width",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Border width",
      "default": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button hover style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_hover_bg_color",
      "label": "Hover background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_hover_text_color",
      "label": "Hover text"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_hover_border_color",
      "label": "Hover border color"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button size"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_font_size",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Font size",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_padding_vertical",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top/bottom",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_padding_horizontal",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding left/right",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_width",
      "label": "Button width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": "Auto"
        },
        {
          "value": "full",
          "label": "Full width"
        }
      ],
      "default": "auto"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Video banner"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
